# fastly_ai_runtime_control_virtual_keys

Use this data source to get the list of virtual keys configured for your customer
account in [Fastly AI Runtime Control][1], optionally filtered by model,
provider, or a substring match on the key name.

~> **Note:** Access tokens are never returned by this endpoint.

